Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.58,0:00:04.46,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}CHIEF OJI AND THE CLASS REUNION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:08.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I was little,{\i0}\N{\i1}I got a stuffed animal from my big sister.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:12.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was the first time{\i0}\N{\i1}I met Pugtaro.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.51,0:00:19.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His soothing texture was there for me{\i0}\N{\i1}even when things went wrong,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:24.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and my obsession with Pugtaro and his{\i0}\N{\i1}indescribable expression began that day.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:26.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:28.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But one day...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:32.91,Font2_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wow, {\i1}that's{\i0} what you're into?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:33.95,Font2_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:36.70,Font2_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're supposed to{\i0}\N{\i1}grow out of this stuff?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.95,0:00:40.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or so I came to realize.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.63,0:00:49.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today, those people who helped me realize{\i0}\N{\i1}you grow out of this stuff with age,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.59,0:00:54.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}my classmates from middle school,{\i0}\N{\i1}are here at this class reunion.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:59.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so nervous...{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.99,0:01:18.50,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}UNCLE'S OBSESSION WITH CUTE THINGS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:35.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's for our entire graduating year,{\i0}\N{\i1}so I wondered what it'd be like...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.49,0:02:38.20,Font2_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's not like I like this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:41.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But there are fewer people here{\i0}\N{\i1}than I expected.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:47.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, not like it's easy to track down{\i0}\N{\i1}classmates from middle school.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:48.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These assigned seats{\i0}\N{\i1}are all over the place, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:50.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Luckily, we all have name tags.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:54.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm in my forties now,{\i0}\N{\i1}long after that traumatic incident.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.17,0:02:55.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And time is a finite thing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's best I attend{\i0}\N{\i1}while I'm still getting invited.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.72,0:03:02.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In a way, it feels new to catch up with{\i0}\N{\i1}classmates who I normally never talk to.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.27,0:03:07.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And most of all, it's about time I tried{\i0}\N{\i1}confronting the trauma in my past.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:09.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At least, that's how I feel now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.36,0:03:12.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or so I thought before I came here...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:15.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I'm still a little scared!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:18.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That said, the people from my class{\i0}\N{\i1}may be one thing,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:23.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but my memories of the other classes{\i0}\N{\i1}are so vague, we're practically strangers.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:29.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even though I can remember{\i0}\N{\i1}my favorite characters perfectly!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:34.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And from the looks of it, I might not even{\i0}\N{\i1}run into anyone from that crowd...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:35.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.01,0:03:39.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Here's to our class reunion!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.09,0:03:41.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.81,0:03:45.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I brought our yearbook!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.23,0:03:47.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:48.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That takes me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.65,0:03:50.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oji-kun, what class were you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:52.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oji was in the same class as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:56.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I made a stupid-looking face,\Nso no need to look me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:03:59.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, here's Oji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.99,0:04:01.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.62,0:04:03.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, is this him?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.62,0:04:03.41,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}OJI MITSUTAKA
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:04.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yep!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:08.58,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They told me to smile, so I forced a weird{\i0}\N{\i1}smile thinking about cute characters!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:11.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I clearly remember how unused to{\i0}\N{\i1}having my photo taken I was back then.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:16.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Isn't it hard as a teenager to be told{\i0}\N{\i1}to smile for the camera?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:18.93,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, it was for me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.93,0:04:21.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So I tried my best,{\i0}\N{\i1}which ended up like that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.89,0:04:23.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never thought I'd have to see that again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:26.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That face is priceless!\NWhat a memento!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.31,0:04:28.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:29.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm blinking in mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:31.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he look so cool now, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:32.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:34.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,He's so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.48,0:04:37.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, are our teachers here as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.07,0:04:38.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, our homeroom teachers are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.95,0:04:42.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My homeroom teacher is here?{\i0}\N{\i1}I didn't see him around.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:47.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Back then, he seemed so grown up.{\i0}\N{\i1}How old is he now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:51.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was pretty easygoing,{\i0}\N{\i1}and always showed up at the last second.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:56.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Despite being a teacher, the grade head,{\i0}\N{\i1}Miya-sensei, would always chew him out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.05,0:04:58.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That brings back memories.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:02.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, Idei-sensei. It's been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.93,0:05:04.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:06.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why does he look like he's {\i0}my{\i1} age?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:08.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm Oji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.39,0:05:09.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oji...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:13.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oji?! I hardly recognize you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.23,0:05:14.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:17.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Miya-sensei, it's Oji.\NDo you remember him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:19.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oji?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:21.74,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, he seems a lot mellower...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:26.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, the one who came by every morning\Nto pick up the key to the classroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:31.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You were such a small and quiet boy,\Nand now you're a grown man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:33.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Was I really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:39.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wow... These two used to be{\i0}\N{\i1}like oil and water...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:40.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How things change.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:45.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Given enough time,{\i0}\N{\i1}would Naruto-kun and I change like that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:46.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not happening.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.76,0:05:48.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Miya-sensei's brought something\Nreally cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:51.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're right! How cute!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.14,0:05:51.60,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something cute, you say?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:55.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, this? My grandchild gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:58.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eek! P-Pugtaro?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.69,0:06:02.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}P-P-Pugtaro? What's Pugtaro doing here?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:05.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that's the last thing I expected{\i0}\N{\i1}to see at my class reunion!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:09.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about him,\Nbut I like how round he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:14.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And he's showing it off without any shame!{\i0}\N{\i1}Proudly talking about how he likes him!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:16.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So cool...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:19.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Setting a good example,{\i0}\N{\i1}as any good teacher would...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:21.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let me follow in your footsteps!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.51,0:06:26.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sensei, thank you for coming today.\NI'm learning so much from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.30,0:06:30.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so glad I attended this class reunion!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.77,0:06:33.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.77,0:06:33.23,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}AFTERWARDS
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:34.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:35.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Oji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:37.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:40.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It really is. So you were here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.61,0:06:42.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Do you remember us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:45.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:47.74,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, how fashionably late!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:48.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Long time, no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:52.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My middle school reunion,{\i0}\N{\i1}which I've avoided all this time...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:59.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I attended in hopes of confronting{\i0}\N{\i1}my trauma, at least a little.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:07.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I figured I might run into one of them{\i0}\N{\i1}from back then, but I never thought...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:10.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They'd all be together!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:15.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if that moment got brought up,{\i0}\N{\i1}I could get through it if they were alone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:18.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But all of them at once?!{\i0}\N{\i1}Wait, I'm not mentally ready.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.94,0:07:23.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Calm down. Despite our past,{\i0}\N{\i1}it's not like I hate any of them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:27.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're my former classmates.{\i0}\N{\i1}We used to talk all the time!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.86,0:07:28.61,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}HAPPENED IN ONE SECOND
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.03,0:07:32.08,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides, I came here today{\i0}\N{\i1}to confront my past!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.08,0:07:33.58,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:35.08,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oji-kun, back then, didn't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:38.04,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yep, here it is already!{\i0}\N{\i1}What? What will you say?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 2,0:07:36.83,0:07:38.04,Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Uma-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:39.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They're asking for you over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:41.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:44.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What about back then?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:47.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is bad for my heart.{\i0}\N{\i1}I'll go grab a drink.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:51.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I got us some beer.\NHow about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:52.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Here's something to nibble on as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:54.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And here comes the next bunch.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:57.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.94,0:08:04.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As long as they don't bring up my trauma,{\i0}\N{\i1}I can enjoy reminiscing about the past.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:08.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Ichikawa, we were in the same class\Nin our first year, weren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.91,0:08:10.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yep, and Nishina was there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:14.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oji, do you remember?\NI'm sure it can't be true now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:17.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?! Could he be talking about...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:21.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Remember how Nishina used to say he'd\Nonly drink melon soda, even as an adult?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:23.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What, are you talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:24.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're holding a beer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.05,0:08:24.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}do{\i0} drink now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:26.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Doesn't ring a bell!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:30.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You know what {\i1}I{\i0} remember?\NThat time when Oji...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.72,0:08:33.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here it is, finally!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:37.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Got real mad when I stole the\Noctopus sausage from his lunch box.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.14,0:08:37.35,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Octopus?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:37.35,0:08:39.19,Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.19,0:08:40.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Did that really happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:43.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,In our second year.\NRemember that, Oji?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:47.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no way I'd remember that!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:52.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What do I remember from back then?\NLet me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:55.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Ichikawa, you always ate lunch early...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.03,0:08:58.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Nishina always got yelled at by\Nour social studies teacher...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.37,0:09:01.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,And Miyama was always chasing after girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.46,0:09:02.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At least I think they did!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:05.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What? Did I really?\NWasn't that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:07.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I did eat lunch early.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:09.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Those memories are boring!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.38,0:09:10.38,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}HAHAHA
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:13.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still, I'm surprised how everyone{\i0}\N{\i1}remembers things differently.{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.09,0:09:12.30,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}THAT'S HILARIOUS
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.06,0:09:18.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:18.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:20.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From the trauma gang...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:21.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Toura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:24.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, you remember my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:26.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only because you were{\i0}\N{\i1}part of the trauma gang...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:28.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let me grab another plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:29.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll bring us some more beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:31.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The restroom for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:34.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What were you boys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:37.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Just remembering the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:39.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Incidentally, Toura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:41.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You didn't happen to be\Nin our class, did you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:43.29,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, no need to be so polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:45.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's right. I was one class over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:48.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet you remembered my name!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:52.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In fact, the three earlier were the{\i0}\N{\i1}centers of attention in our grade,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:53.84,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and Oji-kun never stood out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:58.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But just look at him now!{\i0}\N{\i1}What happened in these thirty or so years?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:00.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Where's your friend from earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:04.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, Uma-san?\NShe's having fun at a different table.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.94,0:10:06.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:10.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's a relief.{\i0}\N{\i1}The two of them would be too much for me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:15.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, wait! Is that a cute character{\i0}\N{\i1}on the bag of one of the trauma gang?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 2,0:10:14.86,0:10:16.87,Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tori, tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.66,0:10:19.45,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just when I thought nobody{\i0}\N{\i1}had any cute things on display!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:21.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Toura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:24.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could it be that you love this stuff?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:26.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:28.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aren't you a little close?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you love it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:32.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:34.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:37.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They may have laughed at{\i0}\N{\i1}my character merch back then,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:42.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but plenty of people change their tastes{\i0}\N{\i1}and way of thinking after they grow up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:45.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not only is this a chance{\i0}\N{\i1}to confront my trauma...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:48.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe I'll meet a new{\i0}\N{\i1}cute-loving comrade today!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.69,0:10:51.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Toura-san, could it be that\Nyou were hiding your love?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.53,0:10:52.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.78,0:10:58.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-Is Oji-kun trying to say I love him?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:11:01.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It may be true that my heart skips a beat{\i0}\N{\i1}whenever I look at Oji-kun today, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:05.58,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Of course not. I'm married, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:07.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Married? Does that matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:08.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Of course it does!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.79,0:11:13.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It matters whether you're married{\i0}\N{\i1}when it comes to loving cute things?{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.34,0:11:14.63,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}SHOCK
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.05,0:11:14.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd never considered that worldview!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:17.84,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So the charm on your bag...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.84,0:11:19.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh? This?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.84,0:11:21.18,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tori, tori, tori, tori...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:21.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he suddenly changing the subject?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:22.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the one!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:27.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh? Did Oji-kun give me{\i0}\N{\i1}the same charm back in the day?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:29.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way. Is he thinking of someone else?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:33.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But Oji-kun was so plain back then,{\i0}\N{\i1}I might be forgetting things...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:35.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I put it on since\Nmy daughter gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.86,0:11:37.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it's all the rage nowadays.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.20,0:11:38.74,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mm-hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:40.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Not that I'm very familiar with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:41.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're not?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:44.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,My husband reluctantly has one too,\Nafter my daughter attached it on his bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.79,0:11:46.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,His coworkers make fun of him for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:48.29,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Make fun of him...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.29,0:11:50.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oji-kun, what about this charm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.21,0:11:52.04,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:56.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I thought I saw it before somewhere.\NI see. I guess it must be famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.47,0:11:59.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I ended up reflecting on my own{\i0}\Nnaïve{\i1} train of thought.{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.14,0:12:03.10,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}TIME TO LEAVE
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.39,0:12:03.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug... Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.60,0:12:06.93,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Over here if you're joining\Nthe after-party!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:08.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What about you, Oji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:09.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No, I'm calling it a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:14.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sensei! Thank you so much for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:17.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:29.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was so nervous, but my reunion with{\i0}\N{\i1}the trauma gang was pretty anticlimactic.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:33.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides, I'm glad I met my teachers,{\i0}\N{\i1}who can serve as good role models!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.54,0:12:34.04,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}MAN IN EIGHTIES PROUD OF WHAT HE LOVES\NLOOKS YOUNG IN HIS FIFTIES
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:34.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:38.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I never thought I'd run into Pugtaro!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:41.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to try my hardest, too!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:42.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yippee!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:50.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This may be sudden,{\i0}\N{\i1}but I ended up in a mascot suit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:54.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never thought I'd be{\i0}\N{\i1}in this situation...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:58.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just happened to be passing by{\i0}\N{\i1}a local event for kids going on...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:03.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I saw someone taking off{\i0}\N{\i1}a mascot suit like it was a hassle.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:09.91,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wish he'd do it somewhere out of sight,{\i0}\N{\i1}so he doesn't shatter the kids' dreams...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:12.04,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As I stood there, thinking that...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:13.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:15.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.05,0:13:17.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So this, this, and that happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:21.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My neighbor Tanaka-san found me,{\i0}\N{\i1}I got swept up before I knew it...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:22.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:24.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now I'm here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:28.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's my first time{\i0}\N{\i1}wearing something like this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:30.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm a little nervous.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:34.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They told me all I need to do{\i0}\N{\i1}is hand out candy to the kids.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:37.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But right now, I'm a bunny!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.15,0:13:43.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To make the kids think better of bunnies,{\i0}\N{\i1}I need to act as cute as I can!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.07,0:13:45.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, a bunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:47.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll give it my all...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.99,0:13:49.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to play the part...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:51.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}of a bunny!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.21,0:13:54.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Bunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:56.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Kick! Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.59,0:14:02.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is how a bunny gets treated?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:13.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I understood how the man in the suit{\i0}\N{\i1}I saw earlier felt.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.77,0:14:15.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.91,0:14:27.37,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}STATIONERY FAIR
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:32.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cat stationery...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:37.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think of Naruto-kun{\i0}\N{\i1}when it comes to cats...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:42.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would he end up hating these as well?{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.13,0:14:41.13,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Meow...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.72,0:14:45.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And so...{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.72,0:14:50.89,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}INVESTIGATION
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:48.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Chief Naruto forbids the use of character{\i0}\N{\i1}merch in the office.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:50.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it possible to win him over{\i0}\N{\i1}with cat merch?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.85,0:14:52.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We decided to investigate!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:53.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:14:59.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:01.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:04.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Chief Naruto, would you care to use these?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.53,0:15:06.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's in here?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.70,0:15:17.42,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}VERY CARTOONY\NITEM 1: FAIRY TALE KITTY DIE-CUT MEMO PAD
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:17.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fairy Tale Kitty die-cut memo pad!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:20.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I won't use this, since I'm not a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:22.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.43,0:15:30.26,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}MILDLY CARTOONY\NITEM 2: SLIGHTLY REALISTIC CAT PAPER CLIPS
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:30.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cat paper clips!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:32.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You need paper clips for work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.35,0:15:33.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Not using these.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.98,0:15:38.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cat silhouette sticky notes!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.98,0:15:38.81,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}NOT VERY CARTOONY\NITEM 3: CAT SILHOUETTE STICKY NOTES
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:43.44,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I don't need these.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.90,0:15:45.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He thought about it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:48.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's the last of it?\NI'm going back to work—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:50.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:51.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're not done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:53.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This is the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.16,0:15:54.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It better well be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:56.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It is. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.25,0:16:00.71,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}PROMOTIONAL DESK CALENDAR OF CAT PHOTOS
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:16:00.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Desk calendar of cat photos!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No good, huh?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:06.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:12.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I know you're trying to distract me\Nto lower my performance numbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.10,0:16:17.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong.\NI thought you could use these for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:19.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Besides, Chief Naruto...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:22.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You like cats, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:24.98,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.98,0:16:28.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I thought they might lift your spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:29.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.70,0:16:30.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:31.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was messing with you a bit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.95,0:16:36.91,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oji-san, trying to lift my spirits?{\i0}\N{\i1}Is he mocking me?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.91,0:16:39.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did he think such childish trifles{\i0}\N{\i1}would make me happy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:40.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:45.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This kitty calendar's not half bad!{\i0}\N{\i1}In fact, I want it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.75,0:16:48.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, spirit-lifting powers aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.55,0:16:53.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}was{\i0} in need of a desk calendar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:56.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This I'll keep for my own use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:58.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:03.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those frown lines on his forehead...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.19,0:17:07.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guess only real cats do the trick.{\i0}\N{\i1}Too bad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.03,0:17:11.49,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}AFTER WORK
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.03,0:17:11.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.87,0:17:20.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll be leaving early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:24.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:26.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.55,0:17:27.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:30.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was quite the serious look{\i0}\N{\i1}on his face.{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.30,0:17:37.26,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}PUGTARO'S NEW FRIEND\NGOOD PALS WITH PUGTARO
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.64,0:17:36.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe this is happening.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.77,0:17:42.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I could've checked on my way home,{\i0}\N{\i1}but I ended up leaving the office early.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:45.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A new Kit D Land character...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:49.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And a new friend of Pugtaro at that!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:52.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kit D Land's lineup of characters,{\i0}\N{\i1}which are dog-themed...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:56.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Among them all, I love Pugtaro most,{\i0}\N{\i1}and now he's getting a new friend?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.99,0:17:57.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.83,0:18:02.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Searching online didn't bring up{\i0}\N{\i1}any further information.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.41,0:18:04.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, that's only natural.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:07.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}New characters are born every day,{\i0}\N{\i1}and that itself I'm okay with...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.80,0:18:11.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But a new friend for Pugtaro,{\i0}\N{\i1}after all this time?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:17.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do I do with these feelings after{\i0}\N{\i1}having spent over 30 years with Pugtaro?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.97,0:18:19.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How do I describe this feeling?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:23.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a little like loneliness,{\i0}\N{\i1}and a little like jealousy...{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.19,0:18:25.73,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Pug...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.19,0:18:26.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pugtaro's never made me feel{\i0}\N{\i1}uncertain like this before.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:31.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It says they're Pugtaro's friend,{\i0}\N{\i1}so they'll surely interact going forward!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:33.20,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.74,0:18:36.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's more, they're sure to{\i0}\N{\i1}show up in merch together.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:39.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will I be able to love them?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:45.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait! A new friend means more eyes{\i0}\N{\i1}on Kit D Land, and that's a good thing!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.71,0:18:49.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And it's just a new friend for Pugtaro.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:51.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}People meet new people all the time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:53.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So of course Pugtaro would as well...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:54.84,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:58.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.\NDinner will be ready... soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:00.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:05.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did something happen to Uncle at work?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:07.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He had a worried look on his face.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.02,0:19:10.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His friend... What will they be like?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:13.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right now, all I can do...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:17.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is make dinner!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.87,0:19:20.33,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}THE NEXT DAY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.87,0:19:20.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug, pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:28.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.67,0:19:31.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You don't seem to be\Nfeeling well today, Chief Oji.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:36.93,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We thought maybe it was something at work,\Nbut that doesn't seem to be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:40.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,About the only thing we can do\Nis provide you some pick-me-ups!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:43.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You can always ask us for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.64,0:19:46.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thank you. It's not a big deal, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.81,0:19:49.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I feel better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:54.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's wrong, Oji-san?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:03.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no way I could tell them...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:07.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That I'm just worrying about{\i0}\N{\i1}Pugtaro's new friend!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:08.29,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.62,0:20:11.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe I let it show to the point{\i0}\N{\i1}that I concerned my employees.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.79,0:20:12.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How pathetic of me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:17.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pugtaro's never had a new friend before,{\i0}\N{\i1}so I couldn't help myself!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:22.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, they'll announce it soon enough!{\i0}\N{\i1}No point in worrying about it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:27.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If Pugtaro's getting a new friend, then I,{\i0}\N{\i1}Oji Mitsutaka, will have to accept it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.19,0:20:30.65,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}A FEW DAYS LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.19,0:20:30.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.65,0:20:33.90,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}OJI EATERY
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.65,0:20:33.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today's the day of his new friend...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:37.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The news should have come out by now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:47.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.16,0:20:52.29,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}NAME: BOSKICHI\NFAVORITES: I LOVE CHEESE!
Dialogue: 2,0:20:49.16,0:20:52.29,Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\pos(320,49)}FREE SPACE: I'M A LITTLE SCARED OF THUNDER
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.29,0:20:53.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, I think I like him!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:56.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yet another new oshi!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.80,0:21:00.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hooray! Hooray! Hooray!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.09,0:21:01.22,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:09.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Chief Oji, have some refreshments.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.77,0:21:11.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's this, Naruto-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:13.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's rare.\NAre you feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.36,0:21:16.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.23,0:21:18.44,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I was trying to be nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:59.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.21,0:23:02.84,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I can't move forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:07.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's all because Pugtaro\Npressed that weird button!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.22,0:23:10.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.95,0:23:29.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I've been looking all over for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.58,0:23:31.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Boskichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:38.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I came back from the salon,\Nand everyone was gone!

